<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-225db3eb52960bea52a10eb1c3c9f204">Unlock the highest quality location intelligence data and tools with a variety of pricing options.</p>
</div><div class="btn-wrap"><p class="btn-main btn-one fsq_form_expanded__link" dataform="form1-hero-banner-afaa7e3e-21e1-4b35-9f10-02fd817e78ef6ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa">Contact sales</p></div></div></div><div id="form1-hero-banner-afaa7e3e-21e1-4b35-9f10-02fd817e78ef6ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa" class="fsq_form_expanded" style="display:none"><div class="fsq_form_expanded__header"><h2 style="color:#ffffff">Contact Sales</h2></div><div id="fsq_hs_form_hero-banner-afaa7e3e-21e1-4b35-9f10-02fd817e78ef6ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa_1" class="hero-banner__form form-two-col fsq_hs_form" data-forminstance="hero-banner-afaa7e3e-21e1-4b35-9f10-02fd817e78ef" data-hsformregion="eu1" data-hsformportalid="144648280" data-hsformid="6ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa" data-success="Thanks so much for your interest. One of our location experts will get back to you ASAP." style="color:#ffffff"></div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-foursquare-accordion-v2 accordion-v2__body" id="feature_box_v2-fc138891-be02-427b-85ed-718f557d31ce" style="background-color:#000025"><div class="container"><div class="accordion-v2__body_head title-raw"><h2 style="color:#ffffff">Pricing</h2></div><div class="accordion-v2__body_main"><div class="accordion-v2__boxes">
<div id="Spatial_Desktop" class="wp-block-foursquare-accordion-v2-inner accordion-v2__content accordion-v2__box"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading_inner"><h2>Spatial Desktop</h2></div><div class="accordion-v2__handle"><svg width="32" height="21" viewBox="0 0 32 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2 2L16.4643 18L30 2" stroke="#3333FF" stroke-width="3"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-v2__box_content">
<p class="has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-c6560dc95e21545075a6a53e72d68df5"><strong>Features available across all plans</strong></p>



<p><strong>&#8211;</strong> <strong>For GIS professionals:</strong> Advanced desktop software for tech-savvy users.<br><strong>&#8211; Powered by Kepler.gl &amp; DuckDB:</strong> Combines powerful visualization with high-performance spatial queries.<br><strong>&#8211; Superior performance:</strong> Sub-second queries on large datasets, real-time rendering.<br><strong>&#8211; End-to-end workflow:</strong> Supports project creation, data import, querying, visualization, and interaction.<br><strong>&#8211; Flexible &amp; offline capable:</strong> Local/cloud saving, full analytical power without internet.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table aligncenter is-style-regular"><table class="has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#0e134f"><thead><tr><th class="has-text-align-left" data-align="left"><strong><strong>FSQ Spatial Desktop – Basic</strong></strong></th><th><strong><strong>FSQ Spatial Desktop – Standard</strong></strong></th><th><strong><strong>FSQ Spatial Desktop – Pro</strong></strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="has-text-align-left" data-align="left"><strong>$0/month through 2026</strong></td><td>$2<strong>5/month</strong></td><td><strong>$100/month</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="has-text-align-left" data-align="left">Start with basic access to render, query, and analyze. Experience your free preview through 2026.&nbsp;</td><td>Access to render, query, and analyze – with AI assistance from FSQ Spatial Agent.</td><td>Full access to render, query, and analyze – with AI assistance from FSQ Spatial Agent.&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="has-text-align-left" data-align="left"><strong>Plan specs</strong><br><br>$1 worth of agent tokens to preview FSQ Spatial Agent capabilities on 1-5 analyses<br><br>3 GB of total cloud storage<br><br>5 shared projects<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></td><td><strong>Plan specs</strong><br><br>$25 worth of agent tokens per billing period for up to 200 simple analyses or up to 30 complex analyses<br><br>5 GB of total cloud storage<br><br>15 shared projects<br><br><strong>—<strong>——</strong><br></strong><br>Input: 0.0048 / 1000 tokens<br>Output: 0.024 / 1000 tokens<br><br>Cost per analysis*<br><br>Simple Analysis: $0.48<br>Complex Analysis: $2.88<br></td><td><strong>Plan specs</strong><br><br>$100 worth of agent tokens per billing period for up to 500 simple analyses or up to 100 complex analyses<br><br>15 GB of total cloud storage<br><br>50 shared projects<br><br><strong>—<strong>—</strong>—<br></strong><br>Input: 0.0042 / 1000 tokens<br>Output: 0.021 / 1000 tokens<br><br>Cost per analysis*<br><br>Simple Analysis: $0.42<br>Complex Analysis: $2.52<br></td></tr><tr><td class="has-text-align-left" data-align="left"><strong><a href="https://fsq-spatial-desktop.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/releases/latest.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#2ed9c3" class="has-inline-color"><span class="fsq-external-link">Get started</span> &gt;</mark></a></strong></td><td><strong><a href="https://fsq-spatial-desktop.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/releases/latest.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#2ed9c3" class="has-inline-color"><span class="fsq-external-link">Get started</span> &gt;</mark></a></strong></td><td><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#2ed9c3" class="has-inline-color"><strong><strong><a href="https://fsq-spatial-desktop.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/releases/latest.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#2ed9c3" class="has-inline-color"></mark></a><strong><a href="https://fsq-spatial-desktop.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/releases/latest.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#2ed9c3" class="has-inline-color"><span class="fsq-external-link">Get started</span> &gt;</mark></a></strong></strong></strong></mark></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-a5d3b46f3f771fc130497281444ef4f9"><strong>*<strong>Learn more about Spatial Agent tokens &amp; analyses</strong></strong></p>



<p>&#8211; Use allotted <strong>agent tokens</strong> to execute analyses and utilize computational power with the FSQ Spatial Agent<br>&#8211; Complete <strong>simple analyses </strong>with FSQ Spatial Agent, typically on your own data, with a single dataset (&lt;10 steps and/or tool calls, and up to 4 maps and/or charts).<br>&#8211; Leverage the FSQ Spatial Agent on <strong>complex analyses</strong> (30+ steps, 30+ tool calls, and up to 8 maps and/or charts) which typically include FSQ H3 Hub data or up to 5 datasets</p>
</div></div>



<div id="Spatial_Workbench" class="wp-block-foursquare-accordion-v2-inner accordion-v2__content accordion-v2__box"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading_inner"><h2>Spatial Workbench</h2></div><div class="accordion-v2__handle"><svg width="32" height="21" viewBox="0 0 32 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2 2L16.4643 18L30 2" stroke="#3333FF" stroke-width="3"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-v2__box_content">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size" id="h-fsq-spatial-workbench-developer-plan"><strong>FSQ Spatial Workbench – Developer Plan</strong></h2>



<p></p>



<p style="font-size:15px">$250 / month<br>Free 30-day trial for $0 + usage</p>



<p style="font-size:15px">Free trial for 30 days with no subscription fee – only pay for the compute and storage you use. Analyze, compute, &amp; visualize – all in a single SQL workbench.</p>



<p style="font-size:15px"><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#001dff" class="has-inline-color"><a href="https://spatial-workbench.foursquare.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="fsq-external-link">Start your free trial </span></a></mark></p>



<p class="has-medium-font-size"><strong><strong>Flexible compute options</strong></strong></p>



<p style="font-size:15px"><strong>MotherDuck</strong> is a cloud-native data warehouse built on DuckDB, designed for serverless, collaborative analytics. Storage costs of $0.04/GB may apply.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-regular"><table class="has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#0e134f"><thead><tr><th><strong>MotherDuck – Pulse</strong></th><th><strong>MotherDuck – Standard</strong></th><th><strong>MotherDuck – Jumbo</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Perfect for ad-hoc analysis tasks<br>$0.60/hr</td><td>Built to handle common workloads and transforms<br>$2.40/hr</td><td>For larger workloads with intense transformations<br>$4.80/hr</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
</div></div>



<div id="foursquare_studio" class="wp-block-foursquare-accordion-v2-inner accordion-v2__content accordion-v2__box"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading_inner"><h2>Spatial Studio</h2></div><div class="accordion-v2__handle"><svg width="32" height="21" viewBox="0 0 32 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2 2L16.4643 18L30 2" stroke="#3333FF" stroke-width="3"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-v2__box_content">
<div class="wp-block-foursquare-compare-plans"><div id="studioPlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da6" class="studioplans__body"><div class="container"><div class="studio__body_main align-center"><div class="studio__boxes"><div class="studio__box" style="background-color:#0e134f"><div class="studio__box_content"><h4 style="color:#ffffff">Community user</h4><p class="studio__box_tag" style="color:#ffffff">Always free</p><p class="studio__box_desc" style="color:#ffffff">Best for those exploring the platform and low data storage requirements.</p></div><div class="btns_wrap"><p class="studio__btn btn-main"><a href="https://auth.studio.foursquare.com/u/login/identifier?state=hKFo2SBZaXRMSzFWZUhFVFQ1aXVBTkpUb1F3N1RrN21zYUFhQqFur3VuaXZlcnNhbC1sb2dpbqN0aWTZIEFuQzhzN09PX05TbnUyXzZXUEpDZURzMzdacVNObGF6o2NpZNkgeWJoa2dzWWtPZGNBR0hXbTFjajY2c1NSNm0ya2kzVUg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="fsq-external-link">Create an account</span></a></p></div></div><div class="studio__box" style="background-color:#0e134f"><div class="studio__box_content"><h4 style="color:#ffffff">Enterprise</h4><p class="studio__box_tag" style="color:#ffffff">Custom pricing</p><p class="studio__box_desc" style="color:#ffffff">Scalable pricing designed to grow with your data and organization.</p></div><div class="btns_wrap"><p class="studio__btn btn-main fsq_form_expanded__link" dataform="studio_form_comparePlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da66ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa_1">Contact sales</p></div></div></div></div><div id="studio_form_comparePlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da66ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa_1" class="fsq_form_expanded"><div class="fsq_form_expanded__header"><h2>Contact sales</h2></div><div id="fsq_hs_form_comparePlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da66ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa_1" class="studio_form form-two-col fsq_hs_form" data-forminstance="comparePlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da6_1" data-hsformregion="eu1" data-hsformportalid="144648280" data-hsformid="6ddc3327-5cc6-4c82-be09-529a0fea05aa" data-success="Thanks so much for your interest. One of our location experts will get back to you ASAP."></div></div></div></div><div id="comparePlans-17437116-6dc1-47a4-965c-7782db9f2da6" class="comparePlans__body"><div class="container"><div class="compare_plans-head"><span class="compare_plans-tile"></span><span class="compare_plans-tile">Community</span><span class="compare_plans-tile">Enterprise</span></div><div class="compare_plans-table"><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Pricing</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">Free</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Custom</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Cloud data storage</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">1GB</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Custom (up to 500GB)</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Data catalog</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">Limited access</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Full access</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Database connectors</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">Only planet NICFI</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">All available connectors + <br>new connectors upon request</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Map publishing</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">Public</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Public + password-protected</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Hex Tiles for large scale data processing</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">No access </div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Full access</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Team collaboration</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">No access</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Full access</div></div><div class="compare_plans-row"><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-title" style="background-color:#b8d9f7">Support</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-community " data-title="Community">Community Slack</div><div class="compare_plans-column compare_plans-enterprise " data-title="Enterprise">Slack + email support <br>(24 hour response time)</div></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></div>



<div id="places_api" class="wp-block-foursquare-accordion-v2-inner accordion-v2__content accordion-v2__box"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading"><div class="accordion-v2__box_heading_inner"><h2>Places API</h2></div><div class="accordion-v2__handle"><svg width="32" height="21" viewBox="0 0 32 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2 2L16.4643 18L30 2" stroke="#3333FF" stroke-width="3"></path></svg></div></div><div class="accordion-v2__box_content">
<p><strong>Pay for what you use.</strong> Flexible, volume-based pricing based on your monthly usage of Pro &amp; Premium endpoints with the Foursquare Places API. More calls mean more savings.<br></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size" id="h-places-api-pro-endpoints">Places API Pro endpoints</h2>



<p></p>



<p style="font-size:15px">Pro endpoints include Place Search, Place Details, Autocomplete, Place Match &amp; Geotagging Candidates when requested with default fields.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-regular"><table class="has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color" style="background-color:#0e134f"><tbody><tr><td>0 &#8211; 500 Calls</td><td>501 to 100,000 Calls</td><td>100,001 to 500,000 Calls</td><td>500,001+ Calls</td></tr><tr><td>$0.00 CPM</td><td>$15.00 CPM</td><td>$12.00 CPM</td><td>$9.00 CPM</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="has-medium-font-size"><strong>Places API Premium endpoints</strong></p>



<p style="font-size:15px">Premium endpoints include Tips &amp; Photos. Search, Details, Place Match &amp; Geotagging Candidates are Premium endpoints when requested with premium tier fields.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-regular"><table class="has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#0e134f"><tbody><tr><td>0 &#8211; 100,000 Calls</td><td>100,001 to 500,000 Calls</td><td>500,001+ Calls</td></tr><tr><td>$18.75 CPM</td><td>$15.00 CPM</td><td>$11.25 CPM</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p class="has-medium-font-size"><strong><strong>Places API Ask Endpoints</strong></strong></p>



<p style="font-size:15px">Ask API endpoints can be considered Pro or Premium based on the <a href="https://docs.foursquare.com/fsq-developers-places/reference/response-fields">requested fields</a>. Additionally, please note the unique <a href="https://docs.foursquare.com/fsq-developers-places/reference/rate-limits">rate limits</a> for Ask API.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-regular"><table class="has-white-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-fixed-layout" style="background-color:#0e134f"><tbody><tr><td>Pro</td><td>Premium</td></tr><tr><td>$30.00 CPM</td><td>$36.00 CPM</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
</div></div>
</div></div></div></div>



